{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_038360","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Chico已经12岁了吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"可按这个年纪来说，他是不是有点太小了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……营养不够。一直在森林里逃亡，连吃的都很难保证……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"正是长身体、能吃的时候啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我知道！其实我也不想带着Chico到处跑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可又没有地方能收留他，我只能把他留在身边。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"别责怪自己。有时候，与其让他远离家人待在安全的地方，和家人在一起反而更幸福。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"谢谢……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"但你要答应我。等战斗结束，就让他好好接受教育。让他将来能做游击队之外的工作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"别让他变成一个只懂战斗的男人。现在还来得及。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"嗯。我答应你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"……你知道Chico很宝贝的那本书吗？叫《世界神秘生物百科》。什么尼斯湖水怪、雪人之类的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":131,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"就是所谓的<R=UMA,UMA>吧。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=UMA,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"他真是个孩子……我很担心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"放心。就算长成大人，也有特别喜欢<R=UMA,UMA>的家伙。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=UMA,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"真的吗？？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}